{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/52","id":4539197999,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUaKq7M8AAAABDo6qLw","html_url":"https://github.com/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pull/52","diff_url":"https://github.com/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pull/52.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pull/52.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/issues/52","number":52,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"M5.4: bind provider input proofs and validate reference protocol results","user":{"login":"kl3574","id":31810429,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODEwNDI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31810429?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574","html_url":"https://github.com/kl3574","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Provider 的完整输入证明此前未固定最终目的地和有效性，Responses 终态也未拒绝错误的 assistant 角色。此变更将证明绑定到精确请求 URL、模型/格式/容量和有效性证据，失效后拒绝新准入并保留原回执；Responses 冻结无思考请求，并拒绝终态角色不一致。\n\n- task_id / Issue：M5.4，关联 #29；依赖仍待审的 #51。M5.3 的原失败及补充诊断保留；0010699 双 CI 实际仍 11 成功 / 1 失败，原 5 秒 completed 断言未改，当前时序诊断不等于已修复。\n- 规范：3.0.5 / `2bfd471933be478a7cac51363a0482a87c81ec113c3e6cbdec88cfd139d43f37`；54 core、基线 DDL、数据 schema_version 3.0.0 不变。\n- 源码：`64b5db9` 上完整 Python 实跑 1,838 项通过；随后 `e982a146` 普通合入 M5.3 五个诊断/CI 文件，Web 383 项、lint/typecheck/build 和规范生成检查实跑通过。完整浏览器 94 项通过（8.1m）；44 个顶层 UI 文件前后保全，4 个已有 PNG 直接输出变化在精确 hash 守卫下恢复，原 unchanged=false 保留。\n- 反例：终态角色的原 14 PASS / 1 FAIL，修复后相同 15 项与旧协议 29 项共 44 PASS；证明准入 80 项和真实工厂 1 项通过。原失败、脚本错误和警告均保留。\n- 官方离线参考：固定 wheel 在禁网沙箱实跑 13 个完整输入转换/计数，15 个严格入口反例及错误词表负控分列；5 条实际参考流含 47 个语义事件。离线结果不证明二进制与源码构建等价或托管 API 输入格式等价。\n- 证据：`progress/evidence/2026-09-15/M5.4-*`，含原/公开字节哈希、输入清单、真实命令/退出码、独立审查及公开范围。只发布合成内容和可追溯工程材料，不包含密钥、数据库、实际用户正文或二进制 wheel。\n- 阻塞：生产 InputProof 注册表仍空；真实平台 DeepSeek、搜索、回答质量和教学效果为 NOT_RUN。本地独立供应商冒烟单列，不替代平台验收；本变更无新增真实供应商调用。\n\n本 PR 作为可验证本地工程切片供审查，不关闭 M5.4，不自动合并。继续核查托管完整输入证明，并开展不依赖外发的 M6.1 本地创作流程。\n","created_at":"2026-09-15T16:21:32Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T16:21:32Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"ce2610697a9ef4e094dbbbf6c8be664bbaec4222","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/52/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/52/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/issues/52/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/statuses/81d2b92e2f9ed24631988f860a1fba528f2c4ad7","head":{"label":"kl3574:feat/M5.4-provider-validation","ref":"feat/M5.4-provider-validation","sha":"81d2b92e2f9ed24631988f860a1fba528f2c4ad7","user":{"login":"kl3574","id":31810429,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODEwNDI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31810429?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574","html_url":"https://github.com/kl3574","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/starred{/owner}{/re